{"title":"Withered Husk","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 43 Mummy that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 4 times (1.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: reviveHpFraction: .15</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/embalming-resin\">Embalming Resin</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/withered-husk\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/withered-husk?lv=41\">Lv 41 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/withered-husk?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/withered-husk?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/withered-husk?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>20</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/withered-husk?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>24</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/withered-husk?lv=41\" title=\"Pick level 41\"><td><b>41</b></td><td>203</td><td>27.1</td><td>2,050</td><td class=\"muted\">609 · 37.9 · 6,150</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/withered-husk\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>42</b></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>3</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/withered-husk?lv=43\" title=\"Pick level 43\"><td><b>43</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>5</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/withered-husk?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>20</td><td>in the wilds around 1806, 1045</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/withered-husk?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>24</td><td>in the wilds around 1805, 1058</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"withered-husk\" data-map-level=\"42\">Show level 42 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 1 looted corpses, 10 recorded drops, 422 total, 27–55 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"burial-wrappings\" title=\"Burial Wrappings - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a8f1eee73d79eed6feb5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Burial Wrappings</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Sun King&#39;s Tomb</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 7</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-190\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 56 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 33 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1803, 1048 <span class=\"muted\">· 31 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sun%20King's%20Tomb\">Sun King&#39;s Tomb</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 25 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"withered-husk\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Mummy: <a href=\"#/monster/mummy\">Mummy</a> <span class=\"muted\">(46)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest\">Embalmed Priest</a> <span class=\"muted\">(49)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/781cfb7a1f975aec8cdf.webp\" alt=\"Withered Husk\"></div><h3>Withered Husk</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>42</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 43)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Mummy</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>212</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>27.6</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,100</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.2 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>251 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}